## 3. 核心模块设计

### 3.1 CLI 入口 (oh-cli)

```java
// OhMain.java —— PicoCLI + JLine 终端
@Command(name = "oh", description = "Java OpenHarness - AI coding assistant")
public class OhMain implements Callable<Integer> {

    @Option(names = {"-m", "--model"}, description = "Model to use")
    String model;

    @Option(names = {"-c", "--continue"}, description = "Continue last session")
    boolean continueLast;

    @Option(names = {"-p", "--prompt"}, description = "Initial prompt")
    String initialPrompt;

    @Option(names = {"--log-level"}, description = "DEBUG|INFO|WARN|ERROR")
    String logLevel = "INFO";

    @Override
    public Integer call() {
        LoggingConfig.init(logLevel);
        SessionManager sm = new SessionManager();
        SessionContext ctx = continueLast
            ? sm.restoreLastSession()
            : sm.createSession(Paths.get("."));
        if (model != null) ctx.setModel(model);

        // 使用 AgentScope 的 HarnessAgent + 我们的自定义 Middleware/Tools
        HarnessAgent agent = AgentAssembler.assemble(ctx);

        TerminalUI ui = new TerminalUI(agent, ctx);
        if (initialPrompt != null) {
            return ui.runOnce(initialPrompt);
        }
        return ui.runInteractive();
    }
}
```

### 3.2 AgentAssembler (核心装配，oh-core)

```java
// 装配 HarnessAgent：AgentScope 内核 + 自定义 Middleware + 自定义 Tools
public class AgentAssembler {

    public static HarnessAgent assemble(SessionContext ctx) {
        Settings settings = ctx.getSettings();

        // 1. Model —— 直接使用 AgentScope 的 AnthropicChatModel
        Model model = AnthropicChatModel.builder()
            .apiKey(settings.resolveApiKey())
            .modelName(settings.getModel())
            .build();

        // 2. Toolkit —— AgentScope Toolkit + 我们的自定义工具
        Toolkit toolkit = new Toolkit();
        toolkit.registerObject(new WebSearchTool());
        toolkit.registerObject(new WebFetchTool());
        toolkit.registerAgentTool(new AskUserQuestionTool());
        // AgentScope 内置工具（FilesystemTool, ShellExecuteTool 等）
        // 由 HarnessAgent 自动注册

        // 3. HarnessAgent
        return HarnessAgent.builder()
            .name("oh")
            .model(model)
            .workspace(ctx.getWorkspaceDir())
            .toolkit(toolkit)
            .compaction(CompactionConfig.builder()
                .triggerMessages(30)
                .keepMessages(10)
                .build())
            .middleware(List.of(
                new SystemPromptAssembler(ctx),
                new CostTrackingMiddleware(),
                new SessionPersistenceMiddleware(ctx.getSessionManager().getWriter())
            ))
            .enablePlanMode()
            .build();
    }
}
```

