### 3.6 配置系统 (oh-core)

```java
public class SettingsLoader {
    // 优先级: project > user > system
    // project: <cwd>/.oh/settings.json
    // user:    ~/.oh/settings.json
    // system:  /etc/oh/settings.json

    public Settings load(Path cwd) {
        Settings system  = loadFile(Path.of("/etc/oh/settings.json"));
        Settings user    = loadFile(Path.of(System.getProperty("user.home"), ".oh/settings.json"));
        Settings project = loadFile(cwd.resolve(".oh/settings.json"));
        return merge(system, user, project);
    }

    // API Key 获取优先级: 环境变量 > Keychain > 配置文件
    public String resolveApiKey(Settings settings);
}
```

