#### LogQL 常用查询

```logql
# 查看所有 WARN/ERROR 日志
{app="openharness"} | logfmt | level =~ "WARN|ERROR"

# 按 traceId 串联一次完整请求链路的日志
{app="openharness"} | logfmt | t = "req_abc123"

# 工具执行耗时 > 1s
{app="openharness"} | logfmt | msg =~ "duration" | unwrap duration | duration > 1000

